title: "NANO THERMO-Q Phase 1: Independent Micromagnetic Validation and a Proposed Diamond Spin-Phonon-Magnon Quantum Architecture"
authors:
  - family-names: Inthavong
    given-names: Kevin
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24338147
date-released: 2026-11-18
url: https://zenodo.org/records/24338147
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: report
abstract: >-
  A technical feasibility report of independent classical micromagnetic numerical
  verification for an assumed magnetic-film model and a proposed hybrid diamond
  spin-phonon-magnon quantum architecture. No physical quantum-chip experiment,
  quantum advantage, or new quantum phenomenon is demonstrated.
